{
  "title": "Agent-to-Agent (A2A): Specialist AI Agents Across Systems | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Some jobs are best done by a specialist. In CrestApps for Orchard Core, an Agent profile is a specialist with its own instructions, the A2A Host offers your agents to other systems over the Agent-to-Agent protocol, and the A2A Client lets your assistants call the agents of other systems.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why specialist agents beat one assistant that does everything\n• How Agent profiles, the A2A Host and the A2A Client fit together\n• Creating an Agent profile: description, availability and instructions\n• How your site offers its agents to other systems\n• Adding an A2A connection to another system's host\n• Giving an assistant the connection, and asking a specialist a question\n• Use cases",
